hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-12 : List (List Word)
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-lines-12 = cons "**Inference happens outside.** Description-logic reasoners, Datalog engines and rule systems compute entailments" (cons "over a graph and write the results back as more edges. The written-back edge forgets that it was derived. When a" (cons "premise changes, nothing in the graph says which conclusions depended on it. Materialized inference is a cache" (cons "with no invalidation rule, and query results are worse: they aren't in the graph at all." (cons "" nil))))
